[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mRequired + basic formats[39m
     [38;5;246mRequired fields, email format, min/max length, numeric range. Synchronous, self-contained per field. Covers [39m
     [38;5;246msignup/profile forms without new infrastructure.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Required only, many forms
     [38;5;246mEvery form just needs presence checks; the reuse win is not repeating the loop. Smallest possible abstraction.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Cross-field rules too
     [38;5;246mBasic formats plus rules spanning fields (password confirmation, end-date-after-start). Validators need access to [39m
     [38;5;246mthe whole form, not just one value.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m Async / server-checked rules
     [38;5;246mEverything above plus rules that hit an API (username availability). Introduces promises, pending state, and race [39m
     [38;5;246mhandling into the validation path.[39m
